{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:0ac15c44d33f4b95","name":"Wookiee","source":{"id":"source:reference-0ac15c44d33f4b95","title":"Wookiee","revision":27423,"timestamp":"2026-08-17T05:13:47Z","sha256":"ec0a7cecb0b9563e0837676423519c0782f24fa7756d72df19ed00b0fe882bcb","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=27423","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Wookiee&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-0ac15c44d33f4b95","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Books: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Unleashed Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Unleashed_Campaign_Guide"}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Wookiees are widely recognized as one of the strongest and fiercest intelligent ",{"tag":"a","children":["Species"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Species","referenceId":"reference:56205e12c20fb568"}," in the galaxy. Wookiees have many customs and traditions that revolve around honor and loyalty, including the special bond called the honor family and the sacred pledge called the Life Debt. A Wookiee never uses his or her climbing claws in combat; doing this is considered dishonorable and a sign of madness.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Wookiee Characteristics"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Personality:"]}," Wookiees tend to be honorable, rash, loyal, and short-tempered.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Physical Description:"]}," Wookiees are large furry bipeds, with a typical male standing at 2.2 meters tall and weighing 125 kilograms, while a typical female stands at 2.0 meters tall and weighs 100 kilograms.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Age Groups"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Age_Groups"},":"]}," Wookiees age at the following stages:\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["CHILD\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["YOUNG ADULT\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["ADULT\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["MIDDLE AGE\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["OLD\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["VENERABLE\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["1-12 Years\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["13-17 Years\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["18-300 Years\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["301-350 Years\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["351-399 Years\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["400+ Years\n"]}]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Homeworld:"]}," The forest world of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Kashyyyk"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Kashyyyk","referenceId":"reference:0886d73261c13472"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Languages:"]}," Wookiees speak Shyriiwook, consisting of complex grunts and growls. They understand Basic but lack the ability to speak it.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Example Names:"]}," Chewbacca, Gorwooken, Groznik, Lowbacca, Ralrra, Rorworr, Salporin, Tarfful.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Adventurers:"]}," Wookiee adventurers usually start out as wanderers or explorers as ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scouts"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scouts"},", but some find this path by forming an honor family with (or owning a Life Debt to) other adventurers.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Wookiee Species Traits"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Wookiees share the following Species Traits:\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Ability Modifiers:"]}," All Wookiees receive a +4 bonus to their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Strength"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Strength"},", and +2 bonus to their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Constitution"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Constitution"},", but suffer -2 penalties to their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dexterity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dexterity"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wisdom"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wisdom"},", and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Charisma"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Charisma"},". Wookiees are powerful and hardy, but they aren't agile, tend to be impulsive, and have little patience for diplomacy."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Medium Size:"]}," As Medium creatures, Wookiees have no special bonuses or penalties due to their size."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Speed:"]}," Wookiees have a base speed of 6 squares."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Expert Climber:"]}," Wookiees are great climbers and may choose to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Take 10"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Take_10"}," on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Climb"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Climb","referenceId":"reference:98ca5f27d9642dc7"}," checks, even when distracted or threatened."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Extraordinary Recuperation:"]}," A Wookiee regains ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"}," at double the normal rate (see ",{"tag":"a","children":["Natural Healing"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Natural_Healing"},")."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Intimidating Presence:"]}," Known to pull off the ears of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gundarks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gundarks"},", Wookiees may choose to reroll any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persuasion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persuasion","referenceId":"reference:196fbdc5f1823320"}," check made to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Intimidate"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Intimidate"}," others, but the result of the reroll must be accepted, even if it is worse."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Natively Phonetic:"]}," Wookiees can learn to understand, read, and write (but not speak) other ",{"tag":"a","children":["Languages"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Languages","referenceId":"reference:318655cea4bd2096"},"."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Rage:"]}," Once per day, a Wookiee can fly into a Rage as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},". While Raging, the Wookiee temporarily gains a +2 Rage bonus on melee attack rolls and melee damage rolls, but cannot use ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skills"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skills","referenceId":"reference:66d0f523a379b2de"}," that require patience and concentration, such as ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mechanics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mechanics","referenceId":"reference:1c74a0e2ceaaeb28"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stealth"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stealth","referenceId":"reference:526a40a447ddd7aa"},", or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"},". A fit of Rage lasts for a number of rounds equal to 5 + the Wookiee's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Constitution"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Constitution"}," modifier.\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":["At the end of its Rage, the Wookiee moves -1 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persistent"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persistent"}," step along the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"},". The penalties imposed by this ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persistent Condition"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persistent_Condition"}," persist until the Wookiee takes at least 10 minutes to recuperate, during which time the Wookiee can't engage in any strenuous activity."]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weapon Familiarity (",{"tag":"a","children":["Bowcaster"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bowcaster","referenceId":"reference:e2b6fdac63f81582"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ryyk Blade"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ryyk_Blade","referenceId":"reference:e0d6c42bb425be84"},"):"]}," Wookiees treat the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bowcaster"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bowcaster","referenceId":"reference:e2b6fdac63f81582"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rifle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rifle"}," instead of an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Exotic Weapon (Ranged)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Exotic_Weapon_(Ranged)"},". They additionally treat the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ryyk Blade"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ryyk_Blade","referenceId":"reference:e0d6c42bb425be84"}," as an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Advanced Melee Weapon"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Advanced_Melee_Weapon"}," instead of an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Exotic Weapon (Melee)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Exotic_Weapon_(Melee)"},"."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Automatic Languages:"]}," All Wookiees can speak Shyriiwook and understand Basic."]}]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Wookiee Species Feats"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Books: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rebellion Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rebellion_Era_Campaign_Guide"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Galaxy at War"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Galaxy_at_War"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Wookiee characters have access to the following ",{"tag":"a","children":["Species Feats"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Species_Feats"},". No Species Feats are considered Bonus Feats for any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Heroic Class"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Heroic_Class"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["SPECIES FEAT\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["BENEFITS\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Bowcaster Marksman"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bowcaster_Marksman","referenceId":"reference:47527e24ccc3ee61"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Gain a bonus to damage rolls when you spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," on a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bowcaster"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bowcaster","referenceId":"reference:e2b6fdac63f81582"}," attack.\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Resurgent Vitality"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Resurgent_Vitality","referenceId":"reference:1267bc5953bfb369"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Gain additional Hit Points when catching a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Second Wind"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Second_Wind"},".\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Wroshyr Rage"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wroshyr_Rage","referenceId":"reference:c68d5482732ad32d"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Gain ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bonus Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bonus_Hit_Points"}," when Raging.\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Wrruushi Training"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wrruushi_Training","referenceId":"reference:0c18d36cb67b4e64"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Gain ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bonus Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bonus_Hit_Points"}," on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unarmed Attacks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unarmed_Attacks","referenceId":"reference:e789d7addc29da1c"},". Deny target ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"}," bonus.\n"]}]}]}]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
